\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {3}{\ignorespaces Independent paired random-latency validation: primary disagreement RMS and paired Fuzzy/PI effects for two physical profile grids. Thirty seeds per regime are shared across the three fixed controllers. The moderate comparator is the primary axis-matched PI baseline; stronger PI is a separate fixed candidate. Ratios and pointwise confidence intervals follow the paired-seed protocol, rather than resampling correlated controller updates.}}{19}{figure.caption.17}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:eval_random_primary}{{3}{19}{Independent paired random-latency validation: primary disagreement RMS and paired Fuzzy/PI effects for two physical profile grids. Thirty seeds per regime are shared across the three fixed controllers. The moderate comparator is the primary axis-matched PI baseline; stronger PI is a separate fixed candidate. Ratios and pointwise confidence intervals follow the paired-seed protocol, rather than resampling correlated controller updates}{figure.caption.17}{}}
